      "body": "## Problem\n\n`test_injected_fault_retry_recovers_all_ranks` has failed twice this week (dashboard #2028, #2037): the fault was injected and detected, but detection landed just past the 45s deadline on loaded CI hosts.\n\n## Fix\n\nRaise the deadline from 45s to 75s (slowest fallback is 30s; the margin was too thin for CI startup variance). The test's purpose (verify recovery) is unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: kimi-no-na-wa <kimi-no-na-wa@users.noreply.github.com>\n",
